# What to park from /mnt/data-2tb/orderready into NixOS cold storage (rsync
# filter rules, first match wins). Build output and caches are rebuildable,
# except the mutation receipts and run records under target/or/artifacts that
# evidence files cite by path. The denied fixtures are mode 000 test dirs.
- /cache/
- /oip-parity/
- /oip-r1/
- /wt/*/target/or/artifacts/mutants/*/*/runtime/state/denied/
+ /wt/*/target/
+ /wt/*/target/or/
+ /wt/*/target/or/artifacts/***
- /wt/*/target/**
- target/
- node_modules/
- .venv/
- frontend/dist/
